.TH dalgon-rules 1  "dalgon-rules " 
.SH NAME
dalgon\-rules \- Inspect or test stream rules.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdalgon rules\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIsubcommands\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Inspect or test stream rules.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
dalgon\-rules\-test(1)
